## Error handling

- Wrap every handler body in `try/catch`.
- Return {{REPO_SPECIFIC_ERROR_HELPER}} (or a specific message) in the catch block — never throw unhandled.

```ts
export async function GET(request: NextRequest) {
  try {
    // ...handler logic
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('[GET /api/example]', err)
    return {{ERROR_HELPER}}
  }
}
```

